#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0212 expect=noViolation domain=ADLBC
#note "Both numeric columns hold a value that is not 1, but neither name matches the anchored two-digit ^ANL\\d\\dFN$, so nothing fires. Pins the anchoring and, incidentally, that this rule does not stray onto PMDA-AD0148's variable."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADLBC
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col ANL1FN  type=Num
col PARAMN  type=Num
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | SYSBP | 2 | 2
